  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.1.4:\n\n## Changed\n- Improved handling of image-based bullets. (DOC-6987)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where saving certain documents could throw an InvalidCastException. (DOC-7010)\n- [Report Templates] Fixed an issue where DataTemplate.BatchProcess() incorrectly retained results from previous iteration (DOC-6943)\n- [Report Templates] Fixed a regression where DataTemplate.BatchProcess() threw an InvalidOperationException. (DOC-7009)\n- [Export] Fixed an issue where page numbers in headers or footers did not reflect the correct starting number when exporting documents. (DOC-6945)\n- [Export] Fixed an issue where exporting documents with multiple images could result in extra pages being added to the output. (DOC-7006)",
